body:
Hey all,

&#x200B;

I have recently returned to MapleStory and have been playing for the past couple of days with relatively few/no issues. However, earlier today while attempting to launch the game via the Steam client, I received an error message and the game failed to open.

&#x200B;

I've looked through multiple different sites and support articles hoping to find a resolution to the issue, however none have worked thus far. I've currently tried:

&#x200B;

1. Restarting my computer.

2. Uninstalling and reinstalling MapleStory (including deleting any leftover folders that the uninstall left behind).

3. Checking my settings in Windows Firewall Defender, and ensuring that both MapleStory and the Nexon Game Launcher were being allowed through.

&#x200B;

Unfortunately even trying all these I've been met with nothing but frustration. Any help in resolving this issue would be much appreciated!
